{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f78d2623610f05b60e100366fd5fa3ee8b092920e313b2783ffd3c3559220e8", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だが、\n準備に時間が掛かるらしい。紗代子の様子は……？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》，但准备似乎要花些时间。紗代子现在怎么样了呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "a8cf243076d243cc5b78693467002494e01ee90a55a47b92e802106212eff936", "ja": "ちょっとずつ、つかめてきたかな……？\nでも、もう少しクールな方が……。", "zh": "是不是渐渐找到感觉了……？\n不过，要是再冷酷一点就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e455e8935197b67dbf9dea530aa2c66a5fb268b6cfd438a8d1179d17a2c1eeac", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。始まるまで時間が掛かるそうだ。\n何か飲み物でも持ってこようか？", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。听说还要过一段时间才开始。\n要不要我去拿点喝的来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "7f3598036060d752faea096915a4bd4c6875f856ef8300142af611e8b64433ed", "ja": "{$P$}！　それなら、\n冷たいお茶をいただけますか？　氷いっぱいの！", "zh": "{$P$}！那样的话，可以给我拿杯冰茶吗？要加很多冰块的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1004_p", "source_sha256": "04f218273c02aee60ec2e467de33c4efef843ce1d46344e3390833f72986b830", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\n……もしかして、暑いのか？", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n……难道说，你很热吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "b9acbfc7058065b2074cf11802d64f68abfa51edcfe0e8e2294ad9bafa388796", "ja": "いえ、そういうわけではないんですけど……。\n今日の私は、冷たくありたいんです！", "zh": "不，不是那样，只是……\n今天的我，想要保持冷酷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1006_p", "source_sha256": "56a5b7d41f4f0928986a9d1f38b77503a366e04b354436de9925d64f5458fffb", "ja": "えっ？　どういうことだ？", "zh": "咦？什么准备？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "025bead8db5f3d1773129bdcc5f8c9745a8ca69c6a7a84376fe10dd257630481", "ja": "今日の衣装、清楚で涼しげな感じじゃないですか。\n私、みんなに熱いと言われることもあるので……。", "zh": "今天的服装，不是给人一种清纯又清凉的感觉吗？\n因为有时大家会说我很热情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "abf850b216a2a366e6b708cfc1c3abd249affb0d4f7e5016bdcffdcd3f241d2c", "ja": "少しでも雰囲気に涼しさが出せるように、\nまずは体から冷やしてみようと思ったんです！", "zh": "为了能稍微营造出清凉的氛围，\n我想着首先得让身体冷却下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3cf7585ff3f61405a4df5d377e684914bf45d38e952c04bf3f558af23a07dd2d", "ja": "な、なるほど……。\nそれで冷たいお茶ってわけか。", "zh": "这、这样啊……  \n所以才喝冰茶啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "c76cc4c0019d3f8f59d3dbe8202a475c325ccdcdda742b11f654dd1682bd0aff", "ja": "はい。アイスは食べてみたんですけど、冷たさが\n足りなかったみたいで。お茶を飲んで、今度こそ……！", "zh": "是的。我试着吃了冰淇淋，可好像还是不够凉。所以喝了茶，这次一定……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1011_p", "source_sha256": "239bfd93e769e244fabff3c22e01fa93ed1b91ffd1480da0a331d06803541c65", "ja": "ははっ。紗代子は、いつもやる気に溢れてるからな。\nアイスやお茶で冷たくならないのも当然かもな。", "zh": "哈哈。纱代子总是干劲十足嘛。光靠冰淇淋和茶没法让她冷静下来，也很正常吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1012_p", "source_sha256": "732bd1787b6970cddbc91e71ec8afdfa8e06d7a81fef9c8028dc76c5468135da", "ja": "でも、そうだな……。\n敢えて、今の状態を撮影してもらうのはどうだ？", "zh": "不过，怎么说呢……  \n要不，干脆就让她拍下现在的状态？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "5647e5764527e306bc69ad6af5700d152c35075d1b4e65a66aa1798f9a9c243b", "ja": "今のまま、ですか？\nいつもの私で、涼しげな雰囲気が出せるかどうか……。", "zh": "就保持现在这样吗？\n以平时的我，能不能营造出清凉的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1014_p", "source_sha256": "57bdbfe42f2737a8d8780766b8cf72e2af6f9703fd0a3af41cff1cc9f25fa428", "ja": "そう難しく考えなくていいんじゃないか？\n紗代子が思う『涼しさ』を表現すればいいと思う。", "zh": "不用想得那么复杂吧？\n我觉得，只要表现出紗代子心目中的“清凉感”就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1015_p", "source_sha256": "672bbaefde61565c8ad62a16891fb9b4895245408d76627a863e4ae70fd901b7", "ja": "この写真を通して、どういう気持ちを伝えたいか。\nそれを忘れなければ、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "如果没有忘记想通过这张照片传达什么样的心情，就没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "ba01bab53b10944b94dd10fef75d31a605f753f1c446fbcae913d81afc59a5ef", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}……。\nちょっとだけ考えすぎていたかもしれません。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}……  \n我可能有点想太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "775f366de608463dff7834d7b1df57fff5d945d864416b1e7e3624e98c3e944d", "ja": "私、やってみます！\n私なりに努力して、私にしか出せない涼しげな表情を！", "zh": "我要试试看！\n用我自己的方式努力，展现出只有我才能呈现的那种清爽表情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "457de27db8cab18112703bbbb27fc2444ff595912bdfd811d543d6073c547c61", "ja": "全力の涼しさを見ていてください！\n熱い私も、違う自分も……全部表現してみせますから！", "zh": "请看我全力展现的清凉感！\n无论是热情的我，还是与众不同的自己……我都会全部表现出来给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0363_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4d164e153327421f0f0cde7070cf3b262addbc376e539214283399f3165d7921", "ja": "（紗代子のひたむきな姿勢は、冷たさで隠せるような\nものじゃない。だからこそ、全力だ！　紗代子！）", "zh": "（纱代子那份一心一意的态度，可不是靠冷淡就能隐藏起来的。正因为如此，就该全力以赴！纱代子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
